* **Data Quality & Consistency:**
    * Redis caching helps with consistency. Deduplication and normalization logic should be incorporated into the `ValidationAndCleansingModule`. 
    * Anomaly detection algorithms (e.g., statistical methods or machine learning) can be used in this module to identify inconsistencies.
